WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.340
What is a virus?

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:12.190
A virus is a teeny-tiny little particle, right?

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.929
That it's smaller than a bacteria.

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:17.720
We can't even see viruses with normal microscopes.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.430
We have to use really really high power microscopes
to see them.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.130
A pencil is like one millimeter in diameter.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.910
You can fit almost a half a billion to a billion
different virus particles on

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.500
the tip of the pencil.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.940
That is how small a virus is.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:43.659
And, interestingly, viruses-- scientists have
been studying the natural history of viruses,

00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:49.049
and they think that viruses actually came
into being, they started four billion

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:53.610
years ago, before any other type of life ever
was created.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:01:00.600
So, four billion years is a really long time
to become a very perfect machine,

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.600
right?

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:09.370
And, so, I want to also tell you that there
are millions

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:15.510
and millions of different viruses all over
the planet, and most of these viruses do not

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.780
get us sick,
okay?

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.140
There is a virus for every type of cell.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:24.170
There's tons of viruses
that get-- that go into bacteria.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.390
There's viruses that go into plants.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.250
There's viruses that go into all sorts of
animals.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:33.040
But, for humans, we don't really get sick
by a lot of viruses.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:36.860
There's a number of viruses that we have to
be careful about,

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:42.150
but overall viruses are actually not terribly
harmful for us when we look at the numbers,

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.150
right?

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:47.409
But, for the viruses that are harmful we do
have to think about things like vaccines

00:01:47.409 --> 00:01:51.570
and other types of treatments and other types
of behaviors,

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.890
like the behavior were practicing now called
social distancing.

